  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market Development Facility in Timor Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Market Development Facility is a multi-country initiative that promotes sustainable economic development by aiming to increase incomes for women and men in our partner countries. MDF supports partners from both the business and government sectors to identify and grow commercial opportunities that are profitable, scalable and deliver social and environmental value.</narrative>
  </description>
